Demand period,Setup,holding,2,float32,,,,min,RW,,,,,"0 to 60 minutes, default 60. 0 makes demand show the present value and max demand the maximum since the last reset"
Pulse 1 width,Setup,holding,12,float32,,,,ms,RW,,,,,"60, 100 or 200 ms, default 60"
Network parity and stop bits,Setup,holding,18,float32,,,,,RW,,,,,"0 = no parity, 1 stop bit; 1 = even, 1 stop (the register table calls this the default; the specification says parity none); 2 = odd, 1 stop; 3 = no parity, 2 stop. Takes effect after a restart"
Meter ID,Setup,holding,20,float32,,,,,RW,,,,,"Modbus address 1 to 247, default 1"
Pulse 1 rate,Setup,holding,22,float32,,,,,RW,,,,,"0 = 0.001, 1 = 0.01, 2 = 0.1, 3 = 1 kWh per pulse"
Baud rate,Setup,holding,28,float32,,,,,RW,,,,,"0 = 2400, 1 = 4800, 2 = 9600 (default), 3 = 19200, 4 = 38400"
Scroll display time,Setup,holding,58,float32,,,,s,RW,,,,,0 to 255 s; 0 (default) = no automatic scrolling
CO2 rate,Setup,holding,70,uint32,,0.0001,,kg/kWh,RW,,,,,"0 to 60 kg per kWh, default 0.5703"
Pulse 1 output mode,Setup,holding,86,float32,,,,,RW,,,,,"1 = import active, 2 = total active (import + export), 4 = export active (default), 5 = import reactive, 6 = total reactive, 8 = export reactive"
Reset historical data,Commands,holding,61456,uint16,,,,,W,,,,0=Reset demand,"The manual documents writes with FC16; Modbench writes a single register with FC06, which the meter may reject"
Scroll display time (BCD),Setup,holding,63744,uint16,,,,,RW,,,,,"BCD, 0 to 30 s (0x0030 = 30 s); 0 = no automatic scrolling. The manual documents writes with FC16; Modbench writes a single register with FC06, which the meter may reject"
Pulse 1 output,Setup,holding,63760,uint16,,,,,RW,,,,0=0.001 kWh/imp|1=0.01 kWh/imp|2=0.1 kWh/imp|3=1 kWh/imp,"The manual documents writes with FC16; Modbench writes a single register with FC06, which the meter may reject"
Measurement mode,Setup,holding,63776,uint16,,,,,RW,,,,1=Total = import|2=Total = import + export|3=Total = import - export,"Default 2. The manual documents writes with FC16; Modbench writes a single register with FC06, which the meter may reject"
